  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: JNDIRealm bypass when configured with GSSAPI\n     authentication - HttpServletRequest.login(username, password) calls\n     validated credentials via the GSSAPI SASL mechanism instead of a\n     plain LDAP bind, silently accepting arbitrary passwords\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-55957.patch: preserve DirContext\n       environment, drop the GSSAPI SECURITY_AUTHENTICATION setting\n       before the user-credential bind, and restore it in a finally\n       block via the existing restoreEnvironmentParameter() helper\n     - CVE-2026-55957",
